<title>UK: Bank of Scotland sets 100 million stg Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bank of Scotland sets 100 million stg Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF SCOTLAND TREASURY SERVICES PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANK OF SCOTLAND</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    28.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.582   PAY DATE    11.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.432    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT GILT DUE AUGUST 1999 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
